<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Keep AI-powered work organized from start to finish | StackOS</title><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_by4b0r.png"><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_by4b0r.png"><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_by4b0r.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="600"><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="600"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.z7ALz4wj.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/index.COiJqa9h.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ProblemComparison.BBG-WaOI.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ProductWorkflow.CDLALEC3.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ExecutionStory.DMJAXNLn.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/DomainConstellation.Bi7bJhxK.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ProductGallery.Boce6ROe.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/TrustArchitecture.Brr8KoO1.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/InstallCta.BbG5LVJ-.css" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/_payload.json?aa8e47a4-cf64-43ed-8aa2-6473b185d6eb"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/t2ydJ_7C.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/D77E-YHo.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DIYlYVLR.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/B6FA65gX.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CBNv9QJs.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/2ft739QQ.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/pLYwZrCw.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BxBasbnM.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DBVxaYyc.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DFtP-YMe.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DyzXeEw2.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CkaoiTpL.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Bzkmexai.js"><script type="module" src="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js" crossorigin></script><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="StackOS Library" href="/feed.xml"><meta name="description" content="StackOS runs on your Mac and gives AI clients connected tools, saved project context, and a record of the actions they take."><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b10"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Keep AI-powered work organized from start to finish | StackOS"><meta property="og:description" content="StackOS runs on your Mac and gives AI clients connected tools, saved project context, and a record of the actions they take."><meta name="twitter:title" content="Keep AI-powered work organized from start to finish | StackOS"><meta name="twitter:description" content="StackOS runs on your Mac and gives AI clients connected tools, saved project context, and a record of the actions they take."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/"><meta property="og:site_name" content="StackOS"><script id="unhead:payload" type="application/json">{"titleTemplate":"%s | StackOS"}</script></head><body><div id="__nuxt"><!--[--><div id="top" class="site" data-v-30c344b9><a class="skip-link" href="#main" data-v-30c344b9>Skip to content</a><header class="site-header" data-v-30c344b9><div class="shell site-header__inner"><a aria-current="page" href="/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active brand" aria-label="StackOS home"><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="36" height="36"><span>StackOS</span><small>Work, organized</small></a><nav class="site-nav site-nav--desktop" aria-label="Primary"><a aria-current="page" href="/#why" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Why StackOS</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#workflow" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Workflows</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#proof" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#security" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav><details class="mobile-menu"><summary role="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="site-navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav id="site-navigation" class="site-nav site-nav--mobile" aria-label="Primary"><a aria-current="page" href="/#why" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Why StackOS</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#workflow" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Workflows</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#proof" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a href="/library/" class="">Library</a><a aria-current="page" href="/#security" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav></details></div></header><main id="main" data-v-30c344b9><section class="hero section--ink" data-v-30c344b9><div class="hero__grid shell" data-v-30c344b9><div class="hero__copy" data-v-30c344b9><div class="announcement" data-v-30c344b9><span class="status-dot" data-v-30c344b9></span> Works with your AI tools <b data-v-30c344b9>Runs on your Mac</b></div><h1 data-v-30c344b9>Your AI can do the work.<br data-v-30c344b9><em data-v-30c344b9>StackOS keeps it on track.</em></h1><p class="hero__lede" data-v-30c344b9> Keep using Codex, Claude Code, or Gemini CLI. StackOS runs on your Mac, gives your agent access to connected tools, and keeps the project plan and results available when you return. </p><div class="hero__actions" data-v-30c344b9><a class="button button--signal" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-30c344b9><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="20" height="20" data-v-30c344b9> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-30c344b9>↓</span></a><a class="button button--ghost" href="#workflow" data-v-30c344b9> See how it works <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-30c344b9>↓</span></a></div><p class="hero__guides" data-v-30c344b9> Start with the <a href="/library/articles/use-codex-claude-gemini-with-existing-tools/" class="" data-v-30c344b9>AI client setup guide</a> or <a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-30c344b9>choose a workflow for your first task</a>. </p><ul class="hero__proof" aria-label="StackOS product traits" data-v-30c344b9><li data-v-30c344b9><span data-v-30c344b9>01</span> Keep your current AI tool</li><li data-v-30c344b9><span data-v-30c344b9>02</span> Connect the apps you already use</li><li data-v-30c344b9><span data-v-30c344b9>03</span> See every step and result</li></ul></div><div class="hero__visual" aria-hidden="false" data-v-30c344b9><div class="workbench" aria-label="StackOS local workflow execution preview" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-ca9965db><div class="workbench__bar" data-v-ca9965db><div class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true" data-v-ca9965db><i data-v-ca9965db></i><i data-v-ca9965db></i><i data-v-ca9965db></i></div><code data-v-ca9965db>stackos / fall collection</code><span data-v-ca9965db><i class="status-dot" data-v-ca9965db></i> Live</span></div><div class="workbench__body" data-v-ca9965db><aside class="workbench__rail" aria-hidden="true" data-v-ca9965db><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" data-v-ca9965db><span class="rail-icon is-active" data-v-ca9965db>⌁</span><span class="rail-icon" data-v-ca9965db>□</span><span class="rail-icon" data-v-ca9965db>↗</span><span class="rail-icon rail-icon--bottom" data-v-ca9965db>···</span></aside><div class="workbench__main" data-v-ca9965db><div class="workbench__context" data-v-ca9965db><div data-v-ca9965db><span class="micro-label" data-v-ca9965db>Active work</span><strong data-v-ca9965db>Launch the fall collection</strong></div><span class="status-pill status-pill--running" data-v-ca9965db><i data-v-ca9965db></i> Running</span></div><div class="execution-path" data-v-ca9965db><article class="execution-card execution-card--agent" data-v-ca9965db><div class="execution-card__icon execution-card__icon--brand" data-v-ca9965db><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" data-v-ca9965db></div><div data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>Claude Code · your request</span><strong data-v-ca9965db>Launch our fall collection</strong><code data-v-ca9965db>conversation connected</code></div><b data-v-ca9965db>01</b></article><div class="execution-connector" data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>turns into a plan</span></div><article class="execution-card execution-card--plan" data-v-ca9965db><div class="execution-card__icon" data-v-ca9965db>S</div><div data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>Plan ready for review</span><strong data-v-ca9965db>7 clear steps</strong><code data-v-ca9965db>people · apps · checks · approvals</code></div><b data-v-ca9965db>02</b></article><div class="execution-connector" data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>starts step by step</span></div><article class="execution-card execution-card--action" data-v-ca9965db><div class="execution-card__icon" data-v-ca9965db>↗</div><div data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>Current step · working</span><strong data-v-ca9965db>Build the Shopify collection</strong><code data-v-ca9965db>products · images · inventory</code></div><b data-v-ca9965db>03</b></article></div><div class="workbench__footer" data-v-ca9965db><div class="audit-stamp" data-v-ca9965db><span class="audit-stamp__check" data-v-ca9965db>✓</span><div data-v-ca9965db><strong data-v-ca9965db>4 of 7 steps finished</strong><small data-v-ca9965db>Images ready · products added · progress saved</small></div></div><div class="credential-chip" data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>KEY</span><div data-v-ca9965db><small data-v-ca9965db>Connected app</small><strong data-v-ca9965db>Shopify ready</strong></div></div></div></div></div><div class="workbench__float workbench__float--top" data-v-ca9965db><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="20" height="20" data-v-ca9965db> Claude Code connected </div><div class="workbench__float workbench__float--bottom" data-v-ca9965db><span data-v-ca9965db>Progress</span><strong data-v-ca9965db>waiting · working · done</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="hero__wash" aria-hidden="true" data-v-30c344b9></div></section><section class="proof-rail" aria-label="Current StackOS proof points" data-v-30c344b9><div class="shell proof-rail__grid" data-v-30c344b9><div data-v-30c344b9><strong data-v-30c344b9>Local</strong><span data-v-30c344b9>runs on your Mac</span></div><div data-v-30c344b9><strong data-v-30c344b9>36</strong><span data-v-30c344b9>ready-made workflows</span></div><div data-v-30c344b9><strong data-v-30c344b9>Private</strong><span data-v-30c344b9>your logins stay yours</span></div><div data-v-30c344b9><strong data-v-30c344b9>Complete</strong><span data-v-30c344b9>every step remembered</span></div></div></section><section id="why" class="comparison section section--paper" aria-labelledby="why-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-59f1d1fb><div class="shell" data-v-59f1d1fb><div class="section-heading reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-59f1d1fb><div data-v-59f1d1fb><p class="eyebrow" data-v-59f1d1fb>The gap after a great prompt</p><h2 id="why-title" data-v-59f1d1fb>A conversation can start work.<br data-v-59f1d1fb><em data-v-59f1d1fb>It cannot organize all of it.</em></h2></div><p data-v-59f1d1fb> Real work has steps, people, approvals, apps, and loose ends. StackOS keeps them together after the conversation moves on. </p></div><div class="comparison-grid" data-v-59f1d1fb><article class="comparison-card comparison-card--before reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms;" data-v-59f1d1fb><div class="comparison-card__header" data-v-59f1d1fb><span class="comparison-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-v-59f1d1fb>×</span><div data-v-59f1d1fb><small data-v-59f1d1fb>AI chat on its own</small><h3 data-v-59f1d1fb>A great start.<br data-v-59f1d1fb>A missing middle.</h3></div></div><div class="prompt-window" aria-label="Unsafe ad hoc prompt example" data-v-59f1d1fb><div data-v-59f1d1fb><i data-v-59f1d1fb></i><i data-v-59f1d1fb></i><i data-v-59f1d1fb></i><span data-v-59f1d1fb>agent-chat.txt</span></div><code data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>&gt;</span> Here is the API key…<br data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>&gt;</span> Update the campaign.<br data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>&gt;</span> Remember what you changed. </code></div><ul data-v-59f1d1fb><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>01</span>The plan disappears into a long conversation</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>02</span>People cannot see what is waiting or blocked</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>03</span>Each new chat rebuilds the same setup</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>04</span>Results are scattered across different apps</li></ul></article><article class="comparison-card comparison-card--after reveal" style="--reveal-delay:150ms;" data-v-59f1d1fb><div class="comparison-card__header" data-v-59f1d1fb><span class="comparison-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-v-59f1d1fb>✓</span><div data-v-59f1d1fb><small data-v-59f1d1fb>With StackOS</small><h3 data-v-59f1d1fb>One clear plan.<br data-v-59f1d1fb>Work that keeps moving.</h3></div></div><div class="control-window" aria-label="StackOS controlled execution example" data-v-59f1d1fb><div class="control-row" data-v-59f1d1fb><span class="control-number" data-v-59f1d1fb>01</span><strong data-v-59f1d1fb>Work plan</strong><code data-v-59f1d1fb>Launch the fall campaign</code><i class="status-pill status-pill--ready" data-v-59f1d1fb>Ready</i></div><div class="control-row" data-v-59f1d1fb><span class="control-number" data-v-59f1d1fb>02</span><strong data-v-59f1d1fb>Current step</strong><code data-v-59f1d1fb>Create three ad directions</code><i class="status-pill status-pill--running" data-v-59f1d1fb>Working</i></div><div class="control-row" data-v-59f1d1fb><span class="control-number" data-v-59f1d1fb>03</span><strong data-v-59f1d1fb>Connected apps</strong><code data-v-59f1d1fb>Canva · Meta Ads</code><i class="status-pill status-pill--ready" data-v-59f1d1fb>Ready</i></div></div><ul data-v-59f1d1fb><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>01</span>Keep using Codex, Claude Code, or Gemini</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>02</span>See the whole plan before work starts</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>03</span>Watch each step move from waiting to done</li><li data-v-59f1d1fb><span data-v-59f1d1fb>04</span>Saved logins stay out of the conversation</li></ul></article></div></div></section><div class="product-workflow-shell" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-68ccb7a7><!--[--><section id="workflow" class="workflow-fallback section section--ink" aria-labelledby="workflow-fallback-title" data-v-68ccb7a7><div class="shell" data-v-68ccb7a7><div class="section-heading section-heading--wide" data-v-68ccb7a7><div data-v-68ccb7a7><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-68ccb7a7>Keep your AI tool. Add a complete way of working.</p><h2 id="workflow-fallback-title" data-v-68ccb7a7>One request becomes<br data-v-68ccb7a7><em data-v-68ccb7a7>a plan you can watch.</em></h2></div><p data-v-68ccb7a7> Ask in Codex, Claude Code, Gemini, or another AI tool. StackOS shows you the full plan, then keeps every step and result connected. </p></div><ol aria-label="StackOS workflow journey" data-v-68ccb7a7><li data-v-68ccb7a7><span data-v-68ccb7a7>01</span><strong data-v-68ccb7a7>Ask in your AI tool</strong><code data-v-68ccb7a7>Request received</code></li><li data-v-68ccb7a7><span data-v-68ccb7a7>02</span><strong data-v-68ccb7a7>See the full plan</strong><code data-v-68ccb7a7>Ready to review</code></li><li data-v-68ccb7a7><span data-v-68ccb7a7>03</span><strong data-v-68ccb7a7>Approve the work</strong><code data-v-68ccb7a7>Ready to start</code></li><li data-v-68ccb7a7><span data-v-68ccb7a7>04</span><strong data-v-68ccb7a7>Watch each step move</strong><code data-v-68ccb7a7>Working</code></li><li data-v-68ccb7a7><span data-v-68ccb7a7>05</span><strong data-v-68ccb7a7>Keep the result</strong><code data-v-68ccb7a7>Complete</code></li></ol></div></section><!--]--></div><section class="execution section section--paper" aria-labelledby="execution-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="shell" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="section-heading section-heading--wide reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div data-v-dc8ad93d><p class="eyebrow" data-v-dc8ad93d>A complete journey, not a one-off prompt</p><h2 id="execution-title" data-v-dc8ad93d>Say what you want.<br data-v-dc8ad93d><em data-v-dc8ad93d>See the plan. Press start.</em></h2></div><p data-v-dc8ad93d> You stay in the AI tool you know. StackOS adds the shared plan, progress, and memory that real work needs. </p></div><div class="execution-track" aria-label="StackOS execution lifecycle" data-v-dc8ad93d><!--[--><article class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-track__topline" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>01</span><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-dc8ad93d></i></div><small data-v-dc8ad93d>Ask</small><h3 data-v-dc8ad93d>Tell your AI tool what you want.</h3><p data-v-dc8ad93d>Stay in Codex, Claude Code, Gemini, or the assistant you already use.</p><code data-v-dc8ad93d>“Launch our fall collection”</code></article><article class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:55ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-track__topline" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>02</span><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-dc8ad93d></i></div><small data-v-dc8ad93d>Build</small><h3 data-v-dc8ad93d>StackOS turns the request into a plan.</h3><p data-v-dc8ad93d>Your request and chosen workflow become clear steps, owners, checks, and approvals.</p><code data-v-dc8ad93d>7 steps prepared</code></article><article class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:110ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-track__topline" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>03</span><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-dc8ad93d></i></div><small data-v-dc8ad93d>Review</small><h3 data-v-dc8ad93d>You see the whole job before it starts.</h3><p data-v-dc8ad93d>Change the order, add context, or approve the plan when it looks right.</p><code data-v-dc8ad93d>ready for approval</code></article><article class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:165ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-track__topline" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>04</span><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-dc8ad93d></i></div><small data-v-dc8ad93d>Work</small><h3 data-v-dc8ad93d>Each step moves in the right tool.</h3><p data-v-dc8ad93d>Your AI works across the apps you connected while StackOS keeps the sequence visible.</p><code data-v-dc8ad93d>step 4 of 7</code></article><article class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:220ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-track__topline" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>05</span><!----></div><small data-v-dc8ad93d>Finish</small><h3 data-v-dc8ad93d>The result and its story stay together.</h3><p data-v-dc8ad93d>See what finished, what changed, what needs attention, and where every result lives.</p><code data-v-dc8ad93d>work complete</code></article><!--]--></div><div class="execution-receipt reveal" style="--reveal-delay:140ms;" data-v-dc8ad93d><div class="execution-receipt__label" data-v-dc8ad93d><span class="status-dot" data-v-dc8ad93d></span> Live work summary </div><div class="execution-receipt__row" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>AI tool</span><strong data-v-dc8ad93d>Claude Code</strong><code data-v-dc8ad93d>connected</code></div><div class="execution-receipt__row" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>Current step</span><strong data-v-dc8ad93d>Create the Shopify collection</strong><code data-v-dc8ad93d>working</code></div><div class="execution-receipt__row" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>Next</span><strong data-v-dc8ad93d>Check inventory and pricing</strong><code data-v-dc8ad93d>waiting</code></div><div class="execution-receipt__row" data-v-dc8ad93d><span data-v-dc8ad93d>Progress</span><strong data-v-dc8ad93d>4 of 7 steps finished</strong><code data-v-dc8ad93d>on track</code></div></div></div></section><section class="domains section section--ink" aria-labelledby="domains-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="shell" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="section-heading section-heading--wide reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div data-v-edeb7b8d><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-edeb7b8d>Not just for software teams</p><h2 id="domains-title" data-v-edeb7b8d>Any team. Any process.<br data-v-edeb7b8d><em data-v-edeb7b8d>The same clear rhythm.</em></h2></div><p data-v-edeb7b8d> StackOS does not replace the software your team already uses. It organizes the work that moves between people, AI tools, and business apps—from the first request to the final result. </p></div><div class="domain-grid" data-v-edeb7b8d><!--[--><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>EN</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Engineering</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Product delivery</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:50ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>CT</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Content</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Research to publishing</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:100ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>FN</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Finance</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Month-end review</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>SH</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Shopify</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Collection launches</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:50ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>CS</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Customer Support</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Issue to resolution</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:100ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>MK</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Marketing</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Campaign production</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>SL</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Sales &amp; RevOps</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Pipeline follow-up</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:50ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>SE</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>SEO</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Opportunity to article</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><article class="domain-card reveal" style="--reveal-delay:100ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="domain-card__glyph" data-v-edeb7b8d>OP</div><div data-v-edeb7b8d><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Operations</strong><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Weekly action review</span></div><code data-v-edeb7b8d>→</code></article><!--]--></div><div class="connect-story reveal" style="--reveal-delay:130ms;" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="connect-story__copy" data-v-edeb7b8d><span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-edeb7b8d>Built around your real work</span><h3 data-v-edeb7b8d>Keep the tools.<br data-v-edeb7b8d>Connect the process.</h3><p data-v-edeb7b8d> Your AI assistant still thinks and acts. Your business apps still hold the work. StackOS gives the whole job a shared plan, visible progress, and a memory that survives the chat. </p></div><div class="connect-path" aria-label="How StackOS connects existing tools" data-v-edeb7b8d><div data-v-edeb7b8d><span data-v-edeb7b8d>1</span><small data-v-edeb7b8d>Talk where you already work</small><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Codex · Claude Code · Gemini</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-edeb7b8d>↓</i><div data-v-edeb7b8d><span data-v-edeb7b8d>2</span><small data-v-edeb7b8d>StackOS organizes the job</small><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Your request · saved workflow · human review</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true" data-v-edeb7b8d>↓</i><div data-v-edeb7b8d><span data-v-edeb7b8d>3</span><small data-v-edeb7b8d>Work moves through your apps</small><strong data-v-edeb7b8d>Shopify · Slack · WordPress · your own tools</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="workflow-marquee" aria-hidden="true" data-v-edeb7b8d><div class="workflow-marquee__track" data-v-edeb7b8d><!--[--><div class="workflow-marquee__group" data-v-edeb7b8d><!--[--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Launch a Shopify collection</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Close the month</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Ship a product update</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Build a content campaign</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Review pipeline risk</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Resolve customer feedback</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Publish an SEO article</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Run a weekly operations review</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="workflow-marquee__group" data-v-edeb7b8d><!--[--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Launch a Shopify collection</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Close the month</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Ship a product update</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Build a content campaign</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Review pipeline risk</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Resolve customer feedback</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Publish an SEO article</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--[--><span data-v-edeb7b8d>Run a weekly operations review</span><i data-v-edeb7b8d>✦</i><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></section><section id="proof" class="gallery section section--paper" aria-labelledby="gallery-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-b0e3bd15><div class="shell" data-v-b0e3bd15><div class="section-heading section-heading--wide reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-b0e3bd15><div data-v-b0e3bd15><p class="eyebrow" data-v-b0e3bd15>Real screens from the product</p><h2 id="gallery-title" data-v-b0e3bd15>See the whole business.<br data-v-b0e3bd15><em data-v-b0e3bd15>See the whole job.</em></h2></div><p data-v-b0e3bd15> StackOS gives you one place to see what is connected, what is moving, what is blocked, and how a complicated piece of work fits together. </p></div><div class="gallery-shell reveal" style="--reveal-delay:100ms;" data-v-b0e3bd15><div class="gallery-shell__bar" data-v-b0e3bd15><div class="gallery-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Product screenshots" data-v-b0e3bd15><!--[--><button id="screen-tab-plugins" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="screen-panel-plugins" class="is-active" data-v-b0e3bd15>Business areas</button><button id="screen-tab-work" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="screen-panel-work" class="" data-v-b0e3bd15>A large piece of work</button><!--]--></div><div class="gallery-shell__local" data-v-b0e3bd15><span class="status-dot" data-v-b0e3bd15></span> Runs on your Mac</div></div><div id="screen-panel-plugins" class="gallery-shell__body" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="screen-tab-plugins" data-v-b0e3bd15><div class="gallery-image" data-v-b0e3bd15><img src="/images/plugins.png" alt="StackOS plugins page showing engineering, support, communications, sales, marketing, branding, media buying, and publishing business areas." width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-b0e3bd15></div><aside data-v-b0e3bd15><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-b0e3bd15>Captured from this StackOS project</p><h3 data-v-b0e3bd15>Built for more than one department.</h3><p data-v-b0e3bd15>Add the parts your business needs—from communications and marketing to Shopify, publishing, SEO, and your own internal tools.</p><div class="gallery-stat" data-v-b0e3bd15><span data-v-b0e3bd15>12 areas in this project</span><code data-v-b0e3bd15>real product data</code></div><ul data-v-b0e3bd15><li data-v-b0e3bd15><span data-v-b0e3bd15>✓</span>Your connected work stays visible</li><li data-v-b0e3bd15><span data-v-b0e3bd15>✓</span>Relationships and blockers stay clear</li><li data-v-b0e3bd15><span data-v-b0e3bd15>✓</span>Results stay attached to the job</li></ul></aside></div></div></div></section><section id="security" class="trust section section--ink" aria-labelledby="trust-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-cb405418><div class="shell trust__grid" data-v-cb405418><div class="trust__copy reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms;" data-v-cb405418><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-cb405418>Your saved logins stay private</p><h2 id="trust-title" data-v-cb405418>Your AI can use your accounts.<br data-v-cb405418><em data-v-cb405418>It never sees the password.</em></h2><p data-v-cb405418> StackOS keeps saved logins inside the app on your Mac. Your AI tool can ask StackOS to use Slack, WordPress, Shopify, or another connected app without receiving the private login. </p></div><div class="trust-visual reveal" aria-label="How StackOS keeps saved logins private" style="--reveal-delay:110ms;" data-v-cb405418><div class="trust-visual__topline" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>Runs on your Mac</span><code data-v-cb405418>Your private workspace</code></div><div class="trust-actor" data-v-cb405418><div class="trust-node trust-node--agent" data-v-cb405418><div class="trust-agent-main" data-v-cb405418><div class="trust-ai-logos" aria-hidden="true" data-v-cb405418><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" width="38" height="38" data-v-cb405418><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="38" height="38" data-v-cb405418><img src="/images/gemini.webp" alt="" width="38" height="38" data-v-cb405418></div><div data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>Your AI tool</span><strong data-v-cb405418>Codex / Claude / Gemini</strong></div></div><code data-v-cb405418>asks StackOS to use a connected app</code></div></div><div class="trust-arrow" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>request</span></div><div class="daemon-boundary" data-v-cb405418><div class="daemon-boundary__label" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>StackOS on your Mac</span><i data-v-cb405418>private workspace</i></div><div class="trust-node trust-node--daemon" data-v-cb405418><div class="daemon-icon" data-v-cb405418><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt="" data-v-cb405418></div><div data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>Saved login</span><strong data-v-cb405418>••••••••••••</strong><code data-v-cb405418>never sent to the AI tool</code></div><b data-v-cb405418>PRIVATE</b></div><div class="daemon-steps" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418><i data-v-cb405418>1</i> check plan</span><span data-v-cb405418><i data-v-cb405418>2</i> unlock login</span><span data-v-cb405418><i data-v-cb405418>3</i> use app</span><span data-v-cb405418><i data-v-cb405418>4</i> hide private data</span><span data-v-cb405418><i data-v-cb405418>5</i> save result</span></div></div><div class="trust-arrow trust-arrow--out" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>uses the connected app</span></div><div class="provider-row" data-v-cb405418><div class="provider-chip" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>SL</span>Slack</div><div class="provider-chip" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>WP</span>WordPress</div><div class="provider-chip" data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>SF</span>Shopify</div></div><div class="trust-receipt" data-v-cb405418><span class="status-dot" data-v-cb405418></span><div data-v-cb405418><strong data-v-cb405418>Only the safe result comes back</strong><small data-v-cb405418>What happened and when is saved on your Mac</small></div><code data-v-cb405418>DONE</code></div></div><div class="trust-principles" data-v-cb405418><div data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>01</span><strong data-v-cb405418>Your AI decides</strong><p data-v-cb405418>Codex, Claude Code, or Gemini works from your request and the current plan.</p></div><div data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>02</span><strong data-v-cb405418>StackOS checks</strong><p data-v-cb405418>Only the right step can use the right connected app, and the login stays private.</p></div><div data-v-cb405418><span data-v-cb405418>03</span><strong data-v-cb405418>Your app works</strong><p data-v-cb405418>Shopify, Slack, WordPress, or another tool completes the requested action.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="home-faq section" aria-labelledby="home-faq-title" data-v-30c344b9><div class="shell home-faq__grid" data-v-30c344b9><div data-v-30c344b9><p class="eyebrow" data-v-30c344b9>Direct answers</p><h2 id="home-faq-title" data-v-30c344b9>What to know before you start.</h2></div><div class="home-faq__items" data-v-30c344b9><!--[--><details data-v-30c344b9><summary data-faq-question data-v-30c344b9>What does StackOS do?</summary><p data-faq-answer data-v-30c344b9>StackOS turns a request from your AI tool into a visible workflow with clear steps, connected tool actions, durable status, and recorded results.</p></details><details data-v-30c344b9><summary data-faq-question data-v-30c344b9>Does StackOS replace Codex, Claude Code, or Gemini?</summary><p data-faq-answer data-v-30c344b9>No. You keep working in your preferred AI tool. StackOS gives that tool an organized, permission-aware way to plan the job, use connected apps, and keep the result.</p></details><details data-v-30c344b9><summary data-faq-question data-v-30c344b9>Where does StackOS run?</summary><p data-faq-answer data-v-30c344b9>StackOS runs locally on your Mac. It keeps workflow state and credential references local while approved connected providers perform their bounded actions.</p></details><!--]--></div></div></section><section id="install" class="install section section--signal" aria-labelledby="install-title" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-3f1a0ce6><div class="shell install__grid" data-v-3f1a0ce6><div class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 0ms" data-v-3f1a0ce6><p class="eyebrow" data-v-3f1a0ce6>Start with the tools you already use</p><h2 id="install-title" data-v-3f1a0ce6>Bring the next job.<br data-v-3f1a0ce6><em data-v-3f1a0ce6>StackOS brings the plan.</em></h2></div><div class="install__action reveal" style="--reveal-delay:100ms;" data-v-3f1a0ce6><p data-v-3f1a0ce6> Install StackOS on your Mac, connect your AI tool, then add the business apps you already rely on. Your first workflow can start from the same conversation you use today. </p><a class="download-card" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-3f1a0ce6><span class="download-card__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-v-3f1a0ce6><img src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="28" height="28" data-v-3f1a0ce6></span><span data-v-3f1a0ce6><small data-v-3f1a0ce6>Latest release · Apple silicon</small><strong data-v-3f1a0ce6>Download for Mac</strong></span><b data-v-3f1a0ce6>DMG</b></a><div class="install__links" data-v-3f1a0ce6><a class="button button--ink" href="#workflow" data-v-3f1a0ce6> See the workflow again <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-3f1a0ce6>↑</span></a><a href="https://github.com/flowmonkeyio/StackOS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-3f1a0ce6> View on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-3f1a0ce6>↗</span></a></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-30c344b9 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a aria-current="page" href="/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a aria-current="page" href="/#why" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a href="/library/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a aria-current="page" href="/#security" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-5f58f905>Download</a><a href="https://github.com/flowmonkeyio/StackOS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-5f58f905>GitHub ↗</a></div></div><div class="site-footer__status" data-v-5f58f905><span class="status-dot" data-v-5f58f905></span><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>Runs on your Mac</strong><small data-v-5f58f905>Your work. Your apps. Your private logins.</small></div></div></div><div class="shell site-footer__bottom" data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>StackOS · Your AI tool works. StackOS keeps the work organized.</span><span data-v-5f58f905>Runs locally.</span></div></footer></div><!----><!--]--></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{siteUrl:"https://stackos.flowmonkey.io",gaMeasurementId:"G-KPZXCGXGG5",downloadUrl:"https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg",scripts:{googleAnalytics:{id:"G-KPZ